OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket truck damages 17th
OL,4,ACentury building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17th Century pavilion which was built
OL,7,Fas a shelter for market stalls has been
OL,8,Fdamaged by a reversing supermarket van.
OL,10,FThe Dunster Yarn Market in Somerset, an
OL,11,Foctagonal pavilion built in 1609, was
OL,12,Fhit by a Tesco delivery truck as it
OL,13,Ftried to reverse around a sharp corner
OL,14,Fon Tuesday night.
OL,16,FA Tesco spokesperson said: "We're very
OL,17,Fsorry that a third-party driver
OL,18,Fdelivering on our behalf has damaged a
OL,19,Fsection of the Dunster Yarn Market."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
