OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket truck damages 17th
OL,4,ACentury building
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Taylor, who runs the Facebook
OL,7,Fgroup Dunster Info, said he was "very
OL,8,Fdisappointed" about the damage to the
OL,9,Fpavilion's roof.
